\par\par \b \uc2 EQS-News: \uc2 Eightco Holdings\uc2  (NASDAQ: ORBS) Reports Total Holdings of Approximately USD436 Million, Includes \uc2 OpenAI\uc2 , \uc2 Beast Industries\uc2 , More Than 16,000 ETH and Over 283 Million WLD Tokens\b0\par\par\uc2 2,257 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 June 2026\par 14:35\par \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires German\par \uc2 RTDJGE\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2026, Dow Jones & Company, Inc. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par EQS-News: \f28 \uc2 \f2 Eightco Holdings\f28 \uc2 \f2  (NASDAQ: ORBS) / Key word(s): Product Launch/Miscellaneous \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 Eightco Holdings\f28 \uc2 \f2  (NASDAQ: ORBS) Reports Total Holdings of Approximately USD436 Million, Includes \f28 \uc2 \f2 OpenAI\f28 \uc2 \f2 , \f28 \uc2 \f2 Beast \par Industries\f28 \uc2 \f2 , More Than 16,000 ETH and Over 283 Million WLD Tokens \par 2026-06-25 / 14:35 CET/CEST \par The issuer is solely responsible for the content of this announcement. \par  \par =---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 Eightco\f28 \uc2 \f2  treasury composition as of June 24, 2026: USD90M \f28 \uc2 \f2 OpenAI\f28 \uc2 \f2  equity (indirect), USD18M \f28 \uc2 \f2 Beast Industries\f28 \uc2 \f2  equity, 16,278 \par ETH, 283 million WLD holdings, and USD149M cash and equivalents, totaling approximately USD436 million \par  \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 Worldcoin\f28 \uc2 \f2  token (WLD) now listed on \f28 \uc2 \f2 Robinhood\f28 \uc2 \f2 , expanding access to millions\u160\'00\'A0 \par  \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 OpenAI\f28 \uc2 \f2  recently announced that it submitted a confidential S-1, setting itself up for an initial\u160\'00\'A0public offering \par  \par World offers a solution to the 'double human' problem in a world proliferating with deepfakes \par  \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 Eightco\f28 \uc2 \f2  provides indirect exposure to some of the most innovative private companies including \f28 \uc2 \f2 OpenAI\f28 \uc2 \f2  and \f28 \uc2 \f2 Beast \par Industries\f28 \uc2 \f2  \par  \par EASTON, Pa., June 25, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- \f28 \uc2 \f2 Eightco Holdings Inc.\f28 \uc2 \f2  (NASDAQ: ORBS) ("\f28 \uc2 \f2 Eightco\f28 \uc2 \f2 " or the "Company") today \par provided an update on its total holdings, highlighting its position across digital assets and strategic investments in \par leading private technology companies. \par  \par As of June 24, 2026, at 6:00 p.m. ET, ORBS' holdings include a USD90 million investment (indirectly, through SPVs) in \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 OpenAI\f28 \uc2 \f2 , an USD18 million funded investment in \f28 \uc2 \f2 Beast Industries\f28 \uc2 \f2 , a USD1 million investment in \f28 \uc2 \f2 Mythical Games\f28 \uc2 \f2 , 283,452,700 \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 Worldcoin\f28 \uc2 \f2  (WLD) at USD0.54 per WLD (per \f28 \uc2 \f2 Coinbase\f28 \uc2 \f2 ), 16,278 Ethereum (ETH), and approximately USD149 million in total cash \par and stablecoins, for total holdings of approximately USD436 million. \par  \par Top Headlines Driving the News: \par  \par ORBS management believes the Company's treasury portfolio holds some of the most critical components for the future AI \par and digital financial system. Among the holdings, key highlights in recent weeks are: \par  \par   . At Cannes Lions, \f28 \uc2 \f2 OpenAI\f28 \uc2 \f2  highlighted its plans to develop advertising into a significant revenue stream. \par     The company said that nearly 20% of ChatGPT queries carry direct commercial intent, with travel, retail, health and \par     beauty, and financial services emerging as the strongest-performing categories to date (\f28 \uc2 \f2 Yahoo\f28 \uc2 \f2 ). \par  \par   . On June 23, \f28 \uc2 \f2 Worldcoin\f28 \uc2 \f2  token became available to trade on \f28 \uc2 \f2 Robinhood\f28 \uc2 \f2 's crypto platform (X.com) which \par     currently serves 28 million customers. \par  \par   . On June 23, \f28 \uc2 \f2 Forbes\f28 \uc2 \f2  ranked MrBeast as the #1 creator on its 2026 Top Creators List, recognizing the rapid \par     growth of \f28 \uc2 \f2 Beast Industries\f28 \uc2 \f2 , its reported USD5 billion valuation, and its expansion into new markets, including \par     personal finance solutions for teens (Forbes). \par  \par   . On June 24, \f28 \uc2 \f2 OpenAI\f28 \uc2 \f2  and \f28 \uc2 \f2 Broadcom\f28 \uc2 \f2  announced Jalape\u241\'00\'F1o, \f28 \uc2 \f2 OpenAI\f28 \uc2 \f2 's first AI processor, marking a major step in \par     their multi-generation effort to build next-generation infrastructure for advanced AI (\f28 \uc2 \f2 OpenAI\f28 \uc2 \f2 ). \par "We continue to see positive developments across each of ORBS' core strategic investments," said \f28 \uc2 \f2 Thomas "Tom" Lee\f28 \uc2 \f2 , \par Board Member of \f28 \uc2 \f2 Eightco\f28 \uc2 \f2 . "To us, we see a validation of World's strategy as \f28 \uc2 \f2 Worldcoin\f28 \uc2 \f2  is listed on \f28 \uc2 \f2 Robinhood\f28 \uc2 \f2  crypto and \par now available to trade for HOOD's 28 million customers. The expected expanded liquidity of\u160\'00\'A0WLD improves the utility of \par WLD token itself in our view. MrBeast remains unmatched as the world's most influential creator and we believe this \par continues to strengthen all of the offerings of \f28 \uc2 \f2 Beast Industries\f28 \uc2 \f2 ." \par  \par "We also believe the strong performance of the \f28 \uc2 \f2 SpaceX\f28 \uc2 \f2  IPO bodes well for the highly anticipated \f28 \uc2 \f2 OpenAI\f28 \uc2 \f2  IPO," said \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 Thomas "Tom" Lee\f28 \uc2 \f2 . \par  \par  \par \u160\'00\'A0 \par  \par  \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 Eightco\f28 \uc2 \f2 : Exposure to key mega-trends \par  \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 Eightco\f28 \uc2 \f2  is built around three mega-trends the Company expects to shape the next decade of innovation: \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 artificial \par intelligence\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , digital identity, and the creator economy, with positions in each trend through indirect investment in \par \f28 \uc2 \f2 OpenAI\f28 \uc2 \f2  (21% of ORBS' treasury holdings), \f28 \uc2 \f2 Worldcoin\f28 \uc2 \f2  (35%), and \f28 \uc2 \f2 Beast Industries\f28 \uc2 \f2  (4%). \par  \par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Artificial Intelligence\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  \u8212\'20\'14 \f28 \uc2 \f2 OpenAI\f28 \uc2 \f2  \par  \par Eightco has invested approximately USD90 million in special purpose vehicles with exposure to equity interests in the \par parent company of \f28 \uc2 \f2 OpenAI\f28 \uc2 \f2 , representing approximately 21% of treasury assets, one of the highest disclosed \par concentrations of any listed vehicle. \par  \par ChatGPT, \f28 \uc2 \f2 OpenAI\f28 \uc2 \f2 's consumer app, is the #1 consumer AI app worldwide (Sensor Tower) and crossed 900 million weekly \par active users in February 2026, making it the fastest-scaling consumer technology in history (\f28 \uc2 \f2 UBS\f28 \uc2 \f2  via Reuters). \par  \par Digital Identity \u8212\'20\'14 WLD Token \par  \par Eightco holds over 283 million WLD, approximately 8.2% of circulating supply, the largest publicly disclosed \par institutional position globally and approximately 35% of the Eightco treasury's assets. \par  \par Worldcoin is the native token of World, a global Proof of Human network built by Tools for Humanity (co-founded by Sam \par Altman and Alex Blania) and stewarded by the World Foundation. Its Orb devices issue a privacy-preserving World ID that \par verifies a user is a unique human, not an AI agent. \par  \par Under World's announced business model, applications pay per-verification fees while end-user verification remains \par free, with both credential issuers and the World protocol monetizing verified-human authentication. World identifies a \par USD6.35 trillion combined addressable revenue opportunity across 13 industries spanning banking, e-commerce, gaming, \par social media, and agentic AI (per Tools for Humanity). \par  \par Creator Economy \u8212\'20\'14 Beast Industries \par  \par Eightco has invested USD18 million in Beast Industries equity, approximately 4% of treasury assets. \par  \par Beast Industries operates one of the largest direct-to-consumer reach footprints in the world, with a combined 500 \par million-plus follower base across platforms, anchored by MrBeast as the most-watched person on YouTube globally. As AI \par commoditizes content production, distribution and audience trust become increasingly scarce assets. \par  \par About Eightco Holdings Inc. \par  \par Eightco Holdings Inc. (NASDAQ: ORBS) is a publicly traded company executing a first-of-its-kind Worldcoin (WLD) \par treasury strategy, providing investors single-ticker indirect exposure to three of the defining trends of this cycle: \par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 artificial intelligence\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  through its indirect investment in OpenAI, digital identity through its position as the largest \par public holder of WLD and the Proof of Human protocol, and the creator economy through its equity stake in MrBeast's \par Beast Industries. Backed by leading institutional investors including Bitmine Immersion Technologies Inc. (NYSE: BMNR), \par MOZAYYX, World Foundation, CoinFund, Discovery Capital Management, FalconX, Payward/Kraken, Pantera, and GSR, Eightco \par is building the infrastructure layer for human verification in the agentic AI era. \par  \par For more information: \par  \par X: @iamhuman_orbs \par  \par Website: 8co.holdings \par  \par Frequently Asked Questions \par  \par What is ORBS stock? \par  \par Eightco Holdings Inc. (NASDAQ: ORBS) is a publicly traded company on Nasdaq. ORBS provides indirect exposure to: OpenAI \par and Beast Industries. \par  \par Who owns the most Worldcoin (WLD)? \par  \par Eightco Holdings (NASDAQ: ORBS) holds 283 million WLD, approximately 8.2% of circulating supply and the largest \par publicly disclosed institutional position globally. \par  \par What is Proof of Human? \par  \par Proof of Human is cryptographic verification that a user is a unique, living person, not a bot or AI agent. It is \par foundational infrastructure for social networks, banking, agentic commerce, and any system requiring "one person, one \par account" in the agentic AI era. \par  \par How does Eightco (ORBS) relate to Proof of Human? \par  \par Eightco Holdings (NASDAQ: ORBS) is the largest publicly disclosed institutional holder of Worldcoin (WLD), the token \par powering World's Proof of Human network. \par  \par Who is the CEO of Eightco Holdings? \par  \par Kevin O'Donnell is the CEO of Eightco Holdings (NASDAQ: ORBS). The Company's Board includes Tom Lee (Managing Partner \par and Head of Research at Fundstrat, and Chairman of Bitmine Immersion Technologies (NYSE: BMNR)) and, as an advisor to \par the Board, Brett Winton (Chief Futurist at ARK Invest). \par  \par Forward-Looking Statements \par  \par This press release contains forward-looking statements within the meaning of the Private Securities Litigation Reform \par Act of 1995. All statements in this press release other than statements of historical fact could be deemed \par forward-looking, including, without limitation, statements regarding: the Company's expectations that \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 artificial \par intelligence\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , digital identity, and the creator economy will shape the next decade of innovation; the Company's belief \par that its treasury portfolio holds some of the most critical components for the future AI and digital financial system; \par the belief that expanded liquidity of WLD improves the utility of the WLD token; statements regarding the potential for \par an initial public offering of OpenAI following its submission of a confidential S-1; the statement that the strong \par performance of the SpaceX IPO bodes well for an OpenAI IPO; statements regarding ChatGPT being the fastest-scaling \par consumer technology in history; statements that Proof-of-Human verification provides foundational infrastructure for \par social networks, banking, agentic commerce, and any system requiring "one person, one account" in the agentic AI era; \par statements that World offers a solution to the "double human" problem in a world proliferating with deepfakes; \par statements regarding World's addressable revenue opportunity of USD6.35 trillion across industries spanning banking, \par e-commerce, gaming, social media, and agentic AI; statements regarding the Company's position as the largest publicly \par disclosed institutional holder of WLD globally; statements that distribution and audience trust become increasingly \par scarce assets as AI commoditizes content production; statements regarding OpenAI's plans to develop advertising into a \par significant revenue stream; statements that MrBeast remains unmatched as the world's most influential creator; and \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par EQS-News: Eightco Holdings (NASDAQ: ORBS) Reports Total Holdings of Approximately USD436 Million, Includes OpenAI, Beast Industries, More Than 16,000 ETH and Over 283 Million WLD Tokens -2-\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par statements regarding the Company building the infrastructure layer for human verification in the agentic AI era. Words \par such as "plans," "expects," "will," "anticipates," "continue," "expand," "advance," "develop," "believes," "guidance," \par "target," "may," "remain," "project," "outlook," "intend," "estimate," "could," "should," and other words and terms of \par similar meaning and expression are intended to identify forward-looking statements, although not all forward-looking \par statements contain such terms. Forward-looking statements are based on management's current beliefs and assumptions \par that are subject to risks and uncertainties and are not guarantees of future performance. Actual results could differ \par materially from those contained in any forward-looking statement as a result of various factors, including, without \par limitation: the Company's inability to direct the management or operations of private businesses where the Company is \par not a controlling stockholder, including OpenAI and Beast Industries; risk of loss or markdown on the Company's \par strategic investments, including its indirect position in OpenAI equity (held through special purpose vehicles), its \par position in WLD, and its position in Beast Industries equity; the Company's ability to maintain compliance with \par Nasdaq's continued listing requirements; unexpected costs, charges or expenses that reduce the Company's capital \par resources or otherwise delay capital deployment; inability to raise adequate capital to fund or scale its business \par operations or strategic investments; volatility in digital asset prices, including WLD and ETH, which could materially \par affect the value of the Company's treasury holdings; regulatory changes, future legislation and rulemaking negatively \par impacting digital assets, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 artificial intelligence\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  adoption, or biometric data collection; risks related to the \par development, adoption, and market acceptance of Proof-of-Human technology and the World network; uncertainty regarding \par the pace and trajectory of agentic AI deployment in enterprise and consumer applications; uncertainty regarding \par OpenAI's product roadmap, business model developments including advertising strategies, and the timing or success of \par any IPO; risks related to Beast Industries' ability to achieve its growth projections; competition in the digital \par identity and AI infrastructure markets; reliance on third-party sources for the valuation of certain investments; \par uncertainty regarding MrBeast's continued success and the performance of Beast Industries' creator-driven business \par model; risks related to the Company's concentrated positions in certain digital assets and private company investments; \par and shifting public and governmental positions on digital assets or \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 artificial intelligence\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 -related industries. Given \par these risks and uncertainties, you are cautioned not to place undue reliance on such forward-looking statements. For a \par discussion of other risks and uncertainties, and other important factors, any of which could cause Eightco's actual \par results to differ from those contained in the forward-looking statements herein, see Eightco's filings with the \par Securities and Exchange Commission (the "SEC"), including the risk factors and other disclosures in its Annual Report \par on Form 10-K filed with the SEC on April 15, 2026 and other publicly available SEC filings. All information in this \par press release is as of the date of the release, and Eightco undertakes no duty to update this information or to \par publicly announce the results of any revisions to any of such statements to reflect future events or developments, \par except as required by law. \par  \par  \par \u160\'00\'A0 \par  \par View original content to download multimedia:\f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.prnewswire.co.uk/news-releases/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.prnewswire.co.uk/news-releases/}}}\uc2 \f2  \par eightco-holdings-nasdaq-orbs-reports-total-holdings-of-approximately-436-million-includes-openai-beast-industries-more-than-16-000-eth-and-over-283-million-wld-tokens-302810136.html \par  \par =---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- \par 2026-06-25 CET/CEST Dissemination of a Corporate News, transmitted by EQS News - a service of EQS Group. \par The issuer is solely responsible for the content of this announcement. \par The EQS Distribution Services include Regulatory Announcements, Financial/Corporate News and Press Releases. \par View original content: EQS News \par  \par =---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------