ineer.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Amazon\uc2 's \uc2 Zoox\uc2  Redesigns Robotaxi for Large-Scale Production\par \par \uc2 Zoox\uc2  plans to move the new robotaxi into large-scale production soon, expecting it will become available to riders later this year.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 OpenAI\uc2 , \uc2 Broadcom\uc2  Develop Custom Chip for AI Inference\par \par \uc2 The chip, called Jalape\u241\'00\'F1o, was built to improve efficiency and lower costs, advancing \uc2 OpenAI\uc2 's strategy to build out a full stack behind its models and products.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Chemours\uc2  to Pay $450 Million to Settle 'Forever Chemicals' Allegations\par \par \uc2 The settlement covers four \uc2 Chemours\uc2  facilities in West Virginia, North Carolina and New Jersey where the company allegedly used or produced per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances (PFAS).\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 How a CFO Shakeup Turned Wendy's Into a Meme Stock\par \par \uc2 The rally came after a slew of posts on the WallStreetBets investing forum urge retail traders to buy the struggling fast-food chain.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Qualcomm\uc2  to Acquire AI Software Firm Modular in $3.9 Billion Stock Deal\par \par \uc2 Qualcomm\uc2  agreed to acquire the AI software company Modular for about $3.9 billion, in a bid to make \b \highlight22\uc2 artificial intelligence\b0 \highlight\uc2  faster and cheaper for its customers.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Memory-Chip Giant SK Hynix Seeks to Raise $29 Billion in U.S. Listing\par \par \uc2 The deal would be one of the biggest share sales in history, comparable to \uc2 Saudi Aramco\uc2 's 2019 IPO.\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 June 25, 2026 01:00 ET (05:00 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Document DJDN000020260625em6p0002r\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
