ineer.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Amazon\uc2 's \uc2 Zoox\uc2  Redesigns Robotaxi for Large-Scale Production\par \par \uc2 Zoox\uc2  plans to move the new robotaxi into large-scale production soon, expecting it will become available to riders later this year.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 OpenAI\uc2 , \uc2 Broadcom\uc2  Develop Custom Chip for AI Inference\par \par \uc2 The chip, called Jalape\u241\'00\'F1o, was built to improve efficiency and lower costs, advancing \uc2 OpenAI\uc2 's strategy to build out a full stack behind its models and products.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Chemours\uc2  to Pay $450 Million to Settle 'Forever Chemicals' Allegations\par \par \uc2 The settlement covers four \uc2 Chemours\uc2  facilities in West Virginia, North Carolina and New Jersey where the company allegedly used or produced per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances (PFAS).\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 How a CFO Shakeup Turned Wendy's Into a Meme Stock\par \par \uc2 The rally came after a slew of posts on the WallStreetBets investing forum urge retail traders to buy the struggling fast-food chain.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Qualcomm\uc2  to Acquire AI Software Firm Modular in $3.9 Billion Stock Deal\par \par \uc2 Qualcomm\uc2  agreed to acquire the AI software company Modular for about $3.9 billion, in a bid to make \b \highlight22\uc2 artificial intelligence\b0 \highlight\uc2  faster and cheaper for its customers.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Hertz\uc2  Dampens Guidance Amid Struggling Used-Car Market\par \par \uc2 Hertz Global\uc2  said its adjusted earnings in the second quarter are shaping up to be on the low end of its expectations after used-car demand was worse than expected.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 EG Group\uc2  Files For U.S. Listing, Targeting $9 Billion Valuation\par \par \uc2 The U.K.-based gas-station operator could raise around $1 billion in the offering, according to two people familiar with the matter.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \