\par\par \b \uc2 SK Hynix\uc2 , \uc2 Samsung\uc2  Shares Rally as AI Optimism Returns\b0\par\par\uc2 358 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 June 2026\par 04:57\par \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2026, Dow Jones & Company, Inc. \par \par \uc2 By P.R. Venkat\par \par \uc2 South Korean chip makers' shares rallied as investors returned to \b \highlight22\uc2 artificial intelligence\b0 \highlight\uc2 -linked names after Micron's blockbuster earnings, adding to optimism over \uc2 SK Hynix\uc2 's planned U.S. listing and a potentially large share buyback by \uc2 Samsung Electronics\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 U.S. chip giant Micron's second-quarter results beat Wall Street expectations in virtually every financial metric watched closely by investors, including sales, earnings per share and adjusted gross margin.\par \par \uc2 The company forecast that rapid growth will continue as demand for its memory chips shows no signs of slowing down. Micron's shares surged in after-hours trading, propelling a rally in Nasdaq futures.\par \par \uc2 SK Hynix\uc2  rose as much as 12% in early trade Thursday, nearing a year-to-date high of 2,945,000 Korean won, equivalent to $1,909.42. The benchmark Kospi was up 4.8%.\par \par \uc2 The company plans to raise more than $29 billion through a U.S. listing, using the proceeds to expand its business as the AI boom fuels demand for advanced chips. Its American depository receipts are expected to start trading July 10.\par \par \uc2 "This ADR of \uc2 SK Hynix\uc2  is likely to have positive near-term impact on the company as it is likely to attract significant amounts of overseas capital," said analyst Douglas Kim of Douglas Research Advisory, who publishes on Smartkarma.\par \par \uc2 Kim said a Nasdaq listing could help narrow the valuation discount the company has long faced in the South Korean market.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, \uc2 Samsung\uc2  rose as much as 6.2% after saying Wednesday that it was planning a share buyback, though details regarding the timing or size have yet to be confirmed.\par \par \uc2 Korean news agency Yonhap reported Wednesday that \uc2 Samsung\uc2  was planning a share buyback program worth about 90 trillion won.\par \par \uc2 Shares of the two Korean companies have been among the biggest beneficiaries of the AI boom. \uc2 SK Hynix\uc2 's stock is up more than fourfold year to date, while \uc2 Samsung\uc2 's shares have nearly tripled.\par \par \uc2 Write to P.R. Venkat at venkat.pr@wsj.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 June 24, 2026 22:57 ET (02:57 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Document DJDN000020260625em6p0001n\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
