\par\par \b \uc2 Dow Jones Top Company Headlines at 7 PM ET: Micron Shares Jump as Chip Shortage Projected to Last Beyond 2027 | Big ...\b0\par\par\uc2 527 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 June 2026\par 01:00\par \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2026, Dow Jones & Company, Inc. \par \par \uc2 Micron Shares Jump as Chip Shortage Projected to Last Beyond 2027\par \par \uc2 Revenue and profit for the chip maker soared on robust memory demand.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Big Banks Ace an Easier Annual Stress Test\par \par \uc2 JPMorgan and Bank of America passed the tests with flying colors after the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  last year began releasing details of the tests in advance.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Lockheed Martin\uc2  Lands $35 Billion Missile-Defense Deal\par \par \uc2 The Pentagon's order of Thaad interceptors follows the company's pledge to expand production over seven years.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 New Drugs Are Replacing Chemo for Aggressive Breast Cancer\par \par \uc2 AstraZeneca\uc2  and Gilead have won approval for treatments of an advanced form of the disease.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 OpenAI\uc2 , \uc2 Broadcom\uc2  Develop Custom Chip for AI Inference\par \par \uc2 The chip, called Jalape\u241\'00\'F1o, was built to improve efficiency and lower costs, advancing \uc2 OpenAI\uc2 's strategy to build out a full stack behind its models and products.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Memory-Chip Giant SK Hynix Seeks to Raise $29 Billion in U.S. Listing\par \par \uc2 The deal would be one of the biggest share sales in history, comparable to \uc2 Saudi Aramco\uc2 's 2019 IPO.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Anthropic\uc2  Veterans' Startup Seeks to Help Scientists Develop Their Own AI\par \par \uc2 Mirendil raises $200 million from \uc2 Andreessen Horowitz\uc2  and \uc2 Kleiner Perkins\uc2  to make AI that can do the job of an AI engineer.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Qualcomm\uc2  to Acquire AI Software Firm Modular in $3.9 Billion Stock Deal\par \par \uc2 Qualcomm\uc2  agreed to acquire the AI software company Modular for about $3.9 billion, in a bid to make \b \highlight22\uc2 artificial intelligence\b0 \highlight\uc2  faster and cheaper for its customers.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Hertz\uc2  Dampens Guidance Amid Struggling Used-Car Market\par \par \uc2 Hertz Global\uc2  said its adjusted earnings in the second quarter are shaping up to be on the low end of its expectations after used-car demand was worse than expected.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Amazon\uc2 's \uc2 Zoox\uc2  Redesigns Robotaxi for Large-Scale Production\par \par \uc2 Zoox\uc2  plans to move the new robotaxi into large-scale production soon, expecting it will become available to riders later this year.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Chemours\uc2  to Pay $450 Million to Settle 'Forever Chemicals' Allegations\par \par \uc2 The settlement covers four \uc2 Chemours\uc2  facilities in West Virginia, North Carolina and New Jersey where the company allegedly used or produced per- and polyfluoroalkyl substances (PFAS).\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 How a CFO Shakeup Turned Wendy's Into a Meme Stock\par \par \uc2 The rally came after a slew of posts on the WallStreetBets investing forum urge retail traders to buy the struggling fast-food chain.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Prologis\uc2  Rebuffed in $16.6 Billion Takeover Approach for U.K.'s Segro\par \par \uc2 The world's largest owner of industrial real estate said it sees a clear strategic rationale for a combination and urged Segro shareholders to encourage the board to engage.\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 Agility, Maker of Humanlike Robots, to Go Public in $2.5 Billion SPAC Deal\par \par \uc2 Agility's humanoid robot, Digit, is used at manufacturing facilities and warehouses by companies such as \uc2 Amazon\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 ----\par \par \uc2 EG Group\uc2  Files For U.S. Listing, Targeting $9 Billion Valuation\par \par \uc2 The U.K.-based gas-station operator could raise around $1 billion in the offering, according to two people familiar with the matter.\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 June 24, 2026 19:00 ET (23:00 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Document DJDN000020260624em6o003ar\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
