\par\par \b \uc2 OpenAI Spices Up the Tech Race with Custom 'Jalape\u241\'00\'F1o' AI Chip -- Barrons.com\b0\par\par\uc2 By Nate Wolf \par \uc2 494 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 June 2026\par 22:45\par \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2026, Dow Jones & Company, Inc. \par \par \uc2 OpenAI\uc2  finally has its own \b \highlight22\uc2 artificial-intelligence\b0 \highlight\uc2  chip, joining an increasingly crowded field of custom chip makers.\par \par \uc2 On Wednesday, the ChatGPT maker unveiled an AI processor called Jalape\u241\'00\'F1o -- yes, like the pepper -- which incorporates silicon from \uc2 Broadcom\uc2  and rack technology from \uc2 Celestica\uc2 . \uc2 OpenAI\uc2  designed the chip specifically for AI inference, which refers to using trained large-language models to execute tasks and solve problems.\par \par \uc2 OpenAI\uc2  and \uc2 Broadcom\uc2  first announced a partnership to build AI accelerators last October.\par \par \uc2 Broadcom\uc2  stock rose 0.5% on Wednesday, while \uc2 Celestica\uc2  surged 3.1%. The broader iShares Semiconductor exchange-traded fund slipped 0.1%.\par \par \uc2 Jalape\u241\'00\'F1o will be part of a broader AI platform set for initial deployment by the end of the year, \uc2 OpenAI\uc2  said. It will eventually be used "at gigawatt scale" with \uc2 OpenAI\uc2 's data-center partners, including \uc2 Microsoft\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 OpenAI\uc2  has been a prolific user of advanced chips. CEO \uc2 Sam Altman\uc2  declared a year ago that the company would have over a million graphics processing units, or GPUs, online by the end of 2025. It now joins peers like \uc2 Alphabet\uc2 , \uc2 Amazon\uc2 , and \uc2 Meta Platforms\uc2  in producing custom chips, which could reduce its reliance on GPU leader \uc2 Nvidia\uc2  and lower costs.\par \par \uc2 "By designing more of the stack ourselves, we can serve more intelligence with greater efficiency and keep pushing advanced AI toward broader access," said \uc2 OpenAI\uc2  President \uc2 Greg Brockman\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 OpenAI\uc2  and its partners still need to prove the custom chips work at scale, but the lift is worth it, according to independent tech analyst Patrick Moorhead.\par \par \uc2 "When your chip suppliers are taking 75+% design margins, companies will find other paths," Moorhead wrote in a social media post Wednesday. "Every hyperscaler and the two big model makers are on the train. Not all will be successful but many will."\par \par \uc2 Showing the public market it can control infrastructure costs would be a win for \uc2 OpenAI\uc2  ahead of its initial public offering. Rival AI lab \uc2 Anthropic\uc2 , which filed confidentially for an IPO a week before \uc2 OpenAI\uc2 , has also explored designing its own chips, Reuters reported in April.\par \par \uc2 Broadcom\uc2 , meanwhile, has established itself as the go-to partner for the aspiring chip makers. Jalape\u241\'00\'F1o is business-as-usual for the California-based company, which will also provide networking technologies for \uc2 OpenAI\uc2 's hardware platform.\par \par \uc2 "This announcement highlights \uc2 Broadcom\uc2  continued ASIC leadership, which is helping diversify its AI revenues across an expanding set of major customers," William Blair analyst Sebastien Naji wrote in a research note Wednesday .\par \par \uc2 William Blair reiterated an Outperform rating on \uc2 Broadcom\uc2  shares, which have jumped 44% over the last 12 months.\par \par \uc2 Write to Nate Wolf at nate.wolf@barrons.com\par \par \uc2 This content was created by Barron's, which is operated by Dow Jones & Co. Barron's is published independently from Dow Jones Newswires and The Wall Street Journal.\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 June 24, 2026 16:45 ET (20:45 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Document DJDN000020260624em6o0034a\par }\par \b \uc2 Search Summary: AI\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbr